  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "Marketingmodulet i eCommerceGo SaaS er designet til at revolutionere den måde, du promoverer din virksomhed på. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Se Live Demo",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Forøg din virksomheds rækkevidde med marketingmodulet",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Boost dit salg med vores kraftfulde marketingmodul, designet til at strømline kampagner, spore ydeevne og fremme vækst uden besvær",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "Opret og rediger din virksomhedsprofil nemt",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "Starte en ny virksomhed eller administrere flere brands? ",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Vælg mellem en række forretningstemaer",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "Marketingmodulet tilbyder også en række tilpassede forretningstemaer for at forbedre dit brands præsentation. ",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Skab vækst med tilpassede marketingkampagner",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "Tag din virksomhed til næste niveau ved at lancere dynamiske marketingkampagner direkte fra platformen. ",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "Strømlin din marketingindsats med alt-i-én-værktøjer",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "Med marketingmodulet har det aldrig været nemmere at administrere din virksomheds marketingindsats. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Hvorfor vælge dedikerede moduler",
  "for your business?": "for din virksomhed?",
  "With EcommerceGo, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Med EcommerceGo kan du nemt administrere alle dine forretningsfunktioner fra et enkelt sted",
  "Empower Your Workforce with EcommerceGo": "Styrk din arbejdsstyrke med EcommerceGo",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Product Enquiry, Product Review, Product Quick-view, and more, all in one place!": "Adgang over Premium-tilføjelser til produktforespørgsel, produktgennemgang, produkthurtigvisning og mere, alt sammen på ét sted!",
